The MT7921AU I/Q capture is the work of Mtk79ICAP (https://github.com/MtkWifiRev/Mtk79ICAP,
MIT and BSD-3-Clause-Clear):
- ../drivers/mt76_icap: the mt76 driver with ICAP I/Q streaming (see its UPSTREAM)
- third_party/libmt7921iq: the IQB2 stream decoder (see its UPSTREAM)
- mt7961_fw.c: the iq_dma_v65 firmware patch, applied to the stock linux-firmware WM
  firmware as it loads; its patch runs and checksums are from Mtk79ICAP's
  firmware/mt7961-iq-fw-v65.py (MIT)

The MT7925 I/Q capture (mt7925_host.c, mt7925_pump/) is our own, on the stock mt7925u driver
and the firmware build it names.  Kismet's usbwifisdr datasource and its signal decoders
live in Kismet, on top of iqradio.h.
